# ── personal data — never commit, never send ───────────────────────────
# Real Spotify exports. These are somebody's complete listening history:
# every track, every timestamp, every device, going back to day one.
# They are test fixtures for whoever owns them and nobody else.
spotify data/
*.zip
my_spotify_data/
**/Streaming_History_*.json
**/Userdata.json

# ── build + dependencies ───────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/

# ── local tooling, not part of the product ─────────────────────────────
# Agent skills used while building. .claude/launch.json is kept — it is the
# run configuration and is genuinely useful to the next person.
.agents/
.claude/skills/
skills-lock.json

# ── editor / OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
